Package: uk.lbsi.motionwake
Name: MotionWake
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Turns the screen on when someone walks in.
 While the iPad is plugged in, the front camera watches the room. Movement
 turns the screen on; after two minutes with no movement it turns off
 again. Never runs on battery. On battery it can also put the iPad to
 sleep below a level you choose (30% by default). Set it up in the
 MotionWake app.
Maintainer: LBSiUK
Author: LBSiUK
Section: Utilities
Depends: firmware (>= 9.0), uikittools
